### BDF LAB 03 - REST Client Test Requests
### Student: P. Pradeep Yadav | Reg No: 252U1R7083
### Course: Backend Development Fundamentals
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 00. Root Route / API Directory
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### ==============================================================================
### SUCCESS CASES (1 to 12)
### ==============================================================================

### 01. Get All Books
GET {{baseUrl}}/books
Accept: application/json

### 02. Get Book by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1
Accept: application/json

### 03. Create a New Book
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Pragmatic Node.js Architect",
  "author": "P. Pradeep Yadav",
  "price": 750,
  "pages": 380
}

### 04. Update an Existing Book
PUT {{baseUrl}}/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code: Revised & Updated",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "price": 720,
  "pages": 475
}

### 05. Delete an Existing Book
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/books/10
Accept: application/json

### 06. Search by Partial Title (LIKE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?search_q=JavaScript
Accept: application/json

### 07. Sort in Ascending Order
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?order_by=price&order=ASC
Accept: application/json

### 08. Sort in Descending Order
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?order_by=price&order=DESC
Accept: application/json

### 09. Apply Limit and Offset (Pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?limit=3&offset=2
Accept: application/json

### 10. Filter by Minimum Price
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?min_price=600
Accept: application/json

### 11. Filter by Maximum Price
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?max_price=800
Accept: application/json

### 12. Apply Minimum and Maximum Price Together
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?min_price=500&max_price=900
Accept: application/json

### ==============================================================================
### FAILURE & VALIDATION CASES (13 to 20)
### ==============================================================================

### 13. Create a Book Without Title (Expected: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "Anonymous Author",
  "price": 500,
  "pages": 200
}

### 14. Create a Book Without Author (Expected: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Book Without Author",
  "price": 500,
  "pages": 200
}

### 15. Create a Book with Non-Numeric Price (Expected: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Book with Non-Numeric Price",
  "author": "Valid Author",
  "price": "free_of_cost",
  "pages": 200
}

### 16. Request a Book With Non-Existing ID (Expected: 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/9999
Accept: application/json

### 17. Update a Non-Existing Book (Expected: 404 Not Found)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/books/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Phantom Book",
  "author": "Ghost",
  "price": 999,
  "pages": 100
}

### 18. Delete a Non-Existing Book (Expected: 404 Not Found)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/books/9999
Accept: application/json

### 19. Invalid Sorting Column (Expected: 400 Bad Request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?order_by=invalid_column
Accept: application/json

### 20. Invalid Sorting Direction (Expected: 400 Bad Request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?order=SIDEWAYS
Accept: application/json

